# Title: Direct Autorun Keys Modification
# ID: 24357373-078f-44ed-9ac4-6d334a668a11
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Victor Sergeev, Daniil Yugoslavskiy, oscd.community, Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2019-10-25
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1547.001
# Description: Detects direct modification of autostart extensibility point (ASEP) in registry using reg.exe.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((CommandLine CONTAIN "add") AND ((CommandLine CONTAIN "\\software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "\\software\\WOW6432Node\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "\\software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Policies\\Explorer\\Run" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "\\software\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Winlogon\\Userinit" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "\\software\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Winlogon\\Shell" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "\\software\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Windows" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "\\system\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\SafeBoot\\AlternateShell")) AND ((Image="*\\reg.exe") OR (OriginalFileName = "reg.exe")))
